U2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/678569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow","html_url":"https://github.com/swinslow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-09-19T12:49:00Z","updated_at":"2023-09-19T12:49:00Z","body":"+1 to add, I don't think this matches anything currently on the list.\r\n\r\n@jlovejoy This is one of those instances where I might suggest _not_ incorporating \"HPND\" into the identifier. I think the disclaimer is substantially different, not just in terminology but also in effect. (For example, the HPND disclaimer excludes only \"special, indirect or consequential damages\" or damages resulting from certain other losses; whereas the license submitted here also excludes \"direct\" damages and \"any damages whatsoever, including without limitation...\"\r\n\r\nFrom some searching the only examples I'm finding for this are from SGI distributions of OpenGL files. In particular the phrase at the start of the second paragraph seems unique to them: \"THE MATERIAL EMBODIED ON THIS SOFTWARE...\"\r\n\r\nGiven that, perhaps go with an identifier like `SGI-OpenGL` and license name \"SGI OpenGL License\"? Could reference the similarity to HPND in the first paragraph if we wanted; or not, since a lot of other licenses on the list have similar grant language with other additions like this one.\r\n\r\nOther instances of use:\r\n* https://courses.cs.washington.edu/courses/csep557/99au/info/OpenGL/material.c -- believe this one is identical\r\n* https://opensource.apple.com/source/X11server/X11server-85/mesa/Mesa-7.2/progs/redbook/unproject.c.auto.html -- identical except for \"OpenGL(R) is a registered trademark\" in final line -- looks like they switched \"TM\" to \"R\" and added \"registered\" at some point. I'd suggest maybe we insert those as markup so that either version matches.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1725449678/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1728337234","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2132#issuecomment-1728337234","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2132","id":1728337234,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85nBFVS","user":{"login":"jlovejoy","id":5048659,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDg2NTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5048659?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy","html_url":"https://github.com/jlovejoy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-09-20T19:51:07Z","updated_at":"2023-09-20T19:51:12Z","body":"# License Inclusion Decision\r\n\r\n## Decision:\r\n\r\n- [x] approved\r\n- [ ] not approved\r\n\r\n## Name\r\n\r\nSGI OpenGL License\r\n\r\n## License ID\r\n\r\nSGI-OpenGL\r\n\r\n## XML markup\r\n\r\nfor last line variations as described above\r\n\r\n## Notes:\r\n\r\nnone\r\n\r\n\r\n## Next steps ##\r\nIf the license has been accepted, please follow [the accepted-license process to create the PR](https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/blob/main/DOCS/request-new-license.md#accepted-license-process). ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1728337234/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1729525872","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2132#issuecomment-1729525872","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2132","id":1729525872,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85nFnhw","user":{"login":"ghost","id":10137,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10137?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost","html_url":"https://github.com/ghost","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.c